{"video":"8shZ89EnA00","lines":[{"t":[0,4.4],"en":"Nice car."},{"t":[4.7,6.1],"en":"Yeah, it's, uh, it's not mine."},{"t":[8.7,9.8],"en":"I love your car."},{"t":[10.2,11.3],"en":"Yeah, it's mine."},{"t":[13.4,14.7],"en":"I bet it's fast."},{"t":[15.1,16.1],"en":"Me too, yeah."},{"t":[17.2,18.2],"en":"And comfortable."},{"t":[18.7,20.6],"en":"Do you, uh, you like leather seats?"},{"t":[20.9,21.5],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[24.2,25.2],"en":"It's got them."},{"t":[29.5,31.4],"en":"Yeah, she tops out at 130."},{"t":[32.4,32.8],"en":"Wow."},{"t":[33.5,34.4],"en":"And that's just in the city."},{"t":[34.6,36.5],"en":"I get her up to 160 when I take her upstate."},{"t":[36.9,37.3],"en":"Really?"},{"t":[38,39],"en":"You got a place upstate?"},{"t":[39.8,40.1],"en":"Sure."},{"t":[42.7,44.1],"en":"Well, I'll, uh, see you later."},{"t":[44.2,45.2],"en":"Okay, take it easy."},{"t":[47.2,47.6],"en":"Hey."},{"t":[48.9,49.6],"en":"That's my car."},{"t":[50.6,50.9],"en":"Really?"},{"t":[51.3,53.8],"en":"Oh, uh, but just give me five more minutes, Will."},{"t":[56,56.9],"en":"What are you doing?"},{"t":[57.6,59.1],"en":"Oh, well, I, uh, I found the keys,"},{"t":[59.1,60.5],"en":"and now I'm just polishing her up."},{"t":[61.2,62.4],"en":"But it's my car."},{"t":[62.8,63.9],"en":"Yeah, but it's my wax."},{"t":[65.8,68.3],"en":"Listen, I, I don't come to this city much,"},{"t":[68.3,69.8],"en":"and I don't know if you're crazy"},{"t":[69.8,72.2],"en":"or if this is some kind of street theater,"},{"t":[72.6,74.9],"en":"but could I have my keys?"},{"t":[75.4,75.6],"en":"Sure."},{"t":[75.9,76],"en":"Here."},{"t":[76.9,78.5],"en":"I'll, uh, I'll save your parking spot."},{"t":[78.6,79.4],"en":"I'm not coming back."},{"t":[80.4,81.1],"en":"Why not?"},{"t":[81.4,82.3],"en":"I live upstate."},{"t":[83.1,84.2],"en":"Yeah, so did I."},{"t":[90.6,92.3],"en":"So the Porsche guy took his car back."},{"t":[95.9,97.7],"en":"But you found the keys to his clothes?"},{"t":[99.6,101.2],"en":"No, I just, uh,"},{"t":[101.2,103.3],"en":"I just love the way it feels"},{"t":[103.3,104.5],"en":"when everybody thinks I own a Porsche."},{"t":[104.9,106.1],"en":"And people would think you own a Porsche"},{"t":[106.1,107.3],"en":"because you're wearing the clothes?"},{"t":[107.5,108.3],"en":"Of course."},{"t":[109.5,111.2],"en":"Only an idiot would wear this stuff"},{"t":[111.2,112.1],"en":"if you didn't have the car."},{"t":[112.1,112.5],"en":"Right?"},{"t":[116,117.3],"en":"That is true."},{"t":[119.2,120.6],"en":"Yeah, but only a genius"},{"t":[120.6,122.3],"en":"would swallow a sonic blaster gun."},{"t":[122.8,124.4],"en":"Oh, I've been there."},{"t":[126.9,129.2],"en":"I am gonna go drive my Porsche."},{"t":[130.4,132.7],"en":"Joey, you know you don't actually have one."},{"t":[132.9,134.4],"en":"Come on, what are you doing?"},{"t":[134.4,135.1],"en":"I'm in character."},{"t":[135.3,136],"en":"Will you talk to her?"},{"t":[138.8,140.3],"en":"Hey, hey, hey, careful."},{"t":[140.5,141.4],"en":"Around my Porsche."},{"t":[144.1,145],"en":"Hi, Joey."},{"t":[145.4,147.4],"en":"Hey, how you doing?"},{"t":[148.6,151.5],"en":"He has the most amazing Porsche under there."},{"t":[151.8,152.6],"en":"I'd love to show you,"},{"t":[152.6,153.9],"en":"but I just tucked her in."},{"t":[154,154.6],"en":"She's sleeping."},{"t":[156,157.3],"en":"Hey, uh, would you two girls"},{"t":[157.3,158.3],"en":"like to go for a drink?"},{"t":[160.1,160.5],"en":"Oh!"}]}
